---
/** 預約表單流程：讀者送出 → Google Apps Script → 分兩條線（寫入試算表、寄通知信） */
---
<figure class="ff">
  <p class="ff-title">預約表單怎麼運作</p>
  <div class="ff-flow">
    <div class="ff-node"><span class="ff-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M9 8h6M9 12h6M9 16h3"/></svg></span><b>讀者填表送出</b><small>網站上的預約表單</small></div>
    <span class="ff-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="ff-node ff-core"><span class="ff-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 7l-5 5 5 5M16 7l5 5-5 5M13.5 5l-3 14"/></svg></span><b>Google Apps Script</b><small>Claude Code 客製</small></div>
    <span class="ff-fork" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="ff-outs">
      <div class="ff-node"><span class="ff-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M3 14.5h18M9 4v16"/></svg></span><b><span class="ff-nb">寫入</span> <span class="ff-nb">Google 試算表</span></b><small>每筆預約自動存檔</small></div>
      <div class="ff-node"><span class="ff-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3.5 6.5l8.5 6.5 8.5-6.5"/></svg></span><b>寄通知信給我</b><small>有人預約馬上知道</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="ff-vs"><span>對照 WordPress：表單外掛需付費</span><span class="ff-free">這次：免費</span></p>
</figure>

<style>
.ff-nb{display:inline-block}
.ff{margin:40px 0 !important;padding:28px 32px 24px;border:1px solid #dddddd;border-radius:12px;background:#ffffff}
.ff-title{margin:0 0 24px;text-align:center;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a}
.ff-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 36px minmax(0,1fr) 36px minmax(0,1.1fr);align-items:center}
.ff-node{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;padding:14px 10px;border:1px solid #dddddd;border-radius:10px;background:#ffffff;text-align:center}
.ff-node b{font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a}
.ff-node small{font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#888888}
.ff-ic{display:flex;margin-bottom:4px}
.ff-ic svg{width:26px;height:26px;fill:none;stroke:#8d1d22;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.ff-core{border-color:#8d1d22;background:#f7ecec}
.ff-core b{color:#5e1216}
.ff-arrow{position:relative;height:2px;margin:0 6px;background:#d9b3b5}
.ff-arrow::after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-2px;top:-5px;border:6px solid transparent;border-left:8px solid #d9b3b5;border-right:0}
/* 分岔：一條橫線接到右側上下兩個節點 */
.ff-fork{position:relative;align-self:stretch;margin:0 0 0 6px}
.ff-fork::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;right:50%;top:50%;border-top:2px solid #d9b3b5}
.ff-fork::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:50%;right:0;top:25%;bottom:25%;border:2px solid #d9b3b5;border-right:0;border-radius:6px 0 0 6px}
.ff-outs{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.ff-vs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:8px 20px;margin:22px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#888888}
.ff-free{color:#8d1d22;font-weight:600}
@media (max-width:760px){
.ff{padding:20px 16px}
.ff-flow{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);row-gap:0}
.ff-arrow,.ff-fork{justify-self:center;width:2px;height:24px;margin:0;align-self:auto}
.ff-arrow::after{right:auto;left:-5px;top:auto;bottom:-2px;border:6px solid transparent;border-top:8px solid #d9b3b5;border-bottom:0}
.ff-fork{background:#d9b3b5}
.ff-fork::before,.ff-fork::after{display:none}
.ff-outs{flex-direction:row;gap:10px}
.ff-outs .ff-node{flex:1 1 0}
}
</style>
